{
  "title": "Zesty Argentinian Pumpkin Roast",
  "description": "A floral, gooey solo-dinner Argentinian dish featuring roasted pumpkin with a bright citrus glaze and a touch of smoky spice.",
  "cuisine": "Argentinian",
